### [3] Registrar Admin
POST {{base_url}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Admin Sistema",
  "email": "admin@teste.com",
  "senha": "admin123",
  "dataNascimento": "1980-01-10T00:00:00",
